{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die Fighter is a dice-based, sci-fi strategy roguelike where every roll is a weapon and a risk.\u00a0 You'll place dice to power a grid of ability tiles, then fend off enemies who turn those same dice against you.\u00a0 Each turn demands a shrewd balance of attack, defense, and planning as you adapt your strategy to your rolls and to your opposition's retaliation.\u00a0 Tactical synergies, dynamic enemy reactions, and the ever-creeping force of Fate push you toward clever plays, careful retreats, and bold risks.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689280?t=1768355633","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689280/f136090ca3022aadb387562ffeeb88926d448a6f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768355633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689280/ccffef3da1fdab7ac1721375e19407168ce8c394/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768355633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689280/ccffef3da1fdab7ac1721375e19407168ce8c394/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768355633","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die Fighter is a dice-based, sci-fi strategy roguelike where every roll is a weapon and a risk.\u00a0 You'll place dice to power a grid of ability tiles, then fend off enemies who turn those same dice against you.\u00a0 Each turn demands a shrewd balance of attack, defense, and planning as you adapt your strategy to yo